    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The projectile ricochets off the top of your head with a loud crack. Your skull has just been fractured!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass a <strong>Hard (-20) Endurance</strong> Test or go @Condition[Unconscious]. Regardless, you also gain @Condition[Fatigued] (2) which will last until the plates of your skull have set again in 30 minus your Toughness Bonus days. Also roll for any Pummel Quality.</p>"
